</span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Force\" title=\"Force\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-force\">Force</span></a> damage when you <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shield_Shove\" title=\"Shield Shove\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4f/Shield_Shove_Icon.webp/25px-Shield_Shove_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4f/Shield_Shove_Icon.webp/38px-Shield_Shove_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4f/Shield_Shove_Icon.webp/50px-Shield_Shove_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shove\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4f/Shield_Shove_Icon.webp/25px-Shield_Shove_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4f/Shield_Shove_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shield_Shove\" title=\"Shield Shove\">Shove</a> a creature. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p><i>(Information not yet added.)</i>\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715140522\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.051 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.056 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 968/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 6723/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2211/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 21/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1601/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.019/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 907078/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   49.538      1 -total\n 52.48%   25.997      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n 47.44%   23.503      1 Template:Inaccessible\n 46.69%   23.127      1 Template:Inac